WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Open Club Batting in Safari.
Tap the More (three dots) menu.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.500
Tap Share.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Tap View More
to show all actions.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:13.708
Choose Add to Home Screen.

00:00:13.708 --> 00:00:19.708
Keep Open as Web App on.
Then tap Add.

00:00:19.708 --> 00:00:22.208
The app is now
on your Home Screen.

00:00:22.208 --> 00:00:24.208
Open the Club Batting icon.

00:00:24.208 --> 00:00:25.708
Sign in if asked.

00:00:25.708 --> 00:00:29.708
Tap Set up notifications.

00:00:29.708 --> 00:00:34.208
Keep both update types ticked.
Tap Enable notifications.

00:00:34.208 --> 00:00:38.000
Tap Allow
on the iPhone prompt.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.500
Check for Notifications on ✓.
Your phone is ready.
